   "ruling": "Ruling: interface gap; f1040s8812 p. 1, line 12, \"Is the amount on line 8 more than the amount on line 11?\", \"No. Stop here. You cannot take the child tax credit, credit for other dependents, or additional child tax credit.\" The line-scoped request (rerun because household.credit_disallowed, which this line reads, was reworded; no expression changed) gave only the pages this line's citations name, and the Schedule 8812 face was not among them, so the reviewer could not verify that line 8 more than line 11 is the test of a credit being figured; it is, by the text quoted. The reviewer found the Form 8862 condition supported. Project stands.",
