   "ruling": "Ruling: scope; MISMATCH. As the earlier rounds: a filer widowed in 2025 who checks single is refused by household.widowed_2025, and a qualifying surviving spouse who remarried fails household.qss_eligible and is refused by household.qss_fails, so this gate need not repeat either test (p501 p. 6, Spouse died during the year; i1040gi p. 15, Qualifying Surviving Spouse). The changed MFS alternative (household.joint_unmarried: refused only when not married at the end of 2025 and no spouse died in 2025) is not objected to and follows p501 p. 6.",
